       "id": "CVE-2026-22751",
       "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
       "shortDescription": {
        "text": "CVE-2026-22751: Time-of-check Time-of-use (TOCTOU) Race Condition"
       },
       "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-22751?s=github&n=spring-security-core&ns=org.springframework.security&t=maven&vr=%3E%3D6.5.0%2C%3C6.5.10",
       "help": {
        "text": "Vulnerability in Spring Spring Security. Applications that explicitly configure One-Time Token login with\u00a0JdbcOneTimeTokenService\u00a0are vulnerable to a Time-of-check Time-of-use (TOCTOU) race condition.\u00a0This issue affects Spring Security: from 6.4.0 through 6.4.15, from 6.5.0 through 6.5.9, from 7.0.0 through 7.0.4.\n",
        "markdown": "> Vulnerability in Spring Spring Security. Applications that explicitly configure One-Time Token login with\u00a0JdbcOneTimeTokenService\u00a0are vulnerable to a Time-of-check Time-of-use (TOCTOU) race condition.\u00a0This issue affects Spring Security: from 6.4.0 through 6.4.15, from 6.5.0 through 6.5.9, from 7.0.0 through 7.0.4.\n\n|                                                                                                                                                  |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:maven/org.springframework.security/spring-security-core@6.5.9  |\n|Affected range                                                                 >=6.5.0,<6.5.10                                                    |\n|Fixed version                                                                  6.5.10                                                             |\n|[[CVSS Score 4.8] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N]]                                                                     |\n"
