       "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-22748?s=github&n=spring-security-oauth2-jose&ns=org.springframework.security&t=maven&vr=%3E%3D6.5.0%2C%3C%3D6.5.9",
       "help": {
        "text": "Vulnerability in Spring Spring Security. When an application configures JWT decoding with\u00a0NimbusJwtDecoder\u00a0 or\u00a0NimbusReactiveJwtDecoder, it must configure an\u00a0OAuth2TokenValidator<Jwt>\u00a0separately, for example by calling\u00a0setJwtValidator. This issue affects Spring Security: from 6.3.0 through 6.3.14, from 6.4.0 through 6.4.14, from 6.5.0 through 6.5.9, from 7.0.0 through 7.0.4.\n",
        "markdown": "> Vulnerability in Spring Spring Security. When an application configures JWT decoding with\u00a0NimbusJwtDecoder\u00a0 or\u00a0NimbusReactiveJwtDecoder, it must configure an\u00a0OAuth2TokenValidator<Jwt>\u00a0separately, for example by calling\u00a0setJwtValidator. This issue affects Spring Security: from 6.3.0 through 6.3.14, from 6.4.0 through 6.4.14, from 6.5.0 through 6.5.9, from 7.0.0 through 7.0.4.\n\n|                                                                                                                                                         |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:maven/org.springframework.security/spring-security-oauth2-jose@6.5.9  |\n|Affected range                                                                 >=6.5.0,<=6.5.9                                                           |\n|Fixed version                                                                  6.5.10                                                                    |\n|[[CVSS Score 5.3] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:H/A:N]]                                                                            |\n"
