      {
       "id": "CVE-2026-47838",
       "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
       "shortDescription": {
        "text": "CVE-2026-47838: Improper Authentication"
       },
       "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-47838?s=github&n=spring-security-web&ns=org.springframework.security&t=maven&vr=%3E%3D6.5.0%2C%3C%3D6.5.10",
       "help": {
        "text": "In Spring Security Web, `SubjectDnX509PrincipalExtractor` does not correctly handle certain malformed X.509 certificate CN values, which can lead to reading the wrong value for the username. In a carefully crafted certificate, this can lead to an attacker impersonating another user.\n\n`SubjectDnX509PrincipalExtractor` is deprecated by this CVE and replaced with `SubjectX500PrincipalExtractor`. As part of updating, you should also migrate to `SubjectX500PrincipalExtractor`.\n\nAffected versions:\nSpring Security Enterprise 5.7.0 through 5.7.24; 5.8.0 through 5.8.26; 6.3.0 through 6.3.17; 6.4.0 through 6.4.17; 6.5.0 through 6.5.10. \nOSS 6.5.0 through 6.5.10.\n",
        "markdown": "> In Spring Security Web, `SubjectDnX509PrincipalExtractor` does not correctly handle certain malformed X.509 certificate CN values, which can lead to reading the wrong value for the username. In a carefully crafted certificate, this can lead to an attacker impersonating another user.\n\n`SubjectDnX509PrincipalExtractor` is deprecated by this CVE and replaced with `SubjectX500PrincipalExtractor`. As part of updating, you should also migrate to `SubjectX500PrincipalExtractor`.\n\nAffected versions:\nSpring Security Enterprise 5.7.0 through 5.7.24; 5.8.0 through 5.8.26; 6.3.0 through 6.3.17; 6.4.0 through 6.4.17; 6.5.0 through 6.5.10. \nOSS 6.5.0 through 6.5.10.\n\n|                                                                                                                                                 |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:maven/org.springframework.security/spring-security-web@6.5.9  |\n|Affected range                                                                 >=6.5.0,<=6.5.10                                                  |\n|Fixed version                                                                  6.5.11                                                            |\n|[[CVSS Score 6.8] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N]]                                                                    |\n"
       },
       "properties": {
        "affected_version": ">=6.5.0,<=6.5.10",
        "cvssV3": 6.8,
        "cvssV3_severity": "MEDIUM",
        "cvssV3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N",
        "fixed_version": "6.5.11",
        "purls": [
         "pkg:maven/org.springframework.security/spring-security-web@6.5.9"
        ],
        "security-severity": "6.8",
        "tags": [
         "MEDIUM"
        ]
       }
