      {
       "id": "CVE-2026-93451",
       "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
       "shortDescription": {
        "text": "CVE-2026-93451: Off-by-one Error"
       },
       "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-93451?s=github&n=snappy-java&ns=org.xerial.snappy&t=maven&vr=%3C%3D1.1.10.8",
       "help": {
        "text": "### Impact\n`Snappy.uncompressCharArray`, `uncompressShortArray`, `uncompressIntArray`, `uncompressLongArray`, `uncompressFloatArray` and `uncompressDoubleArray` sized the result array by dividing the declared uncompressed byte length by the element size, but native code wrote the full byte length. If the declared length is not a multiple of the element size, up to 7 bytes are written past the end of the Java array, corrupting the heap.\n\n### Patches\nFixed in 1.1.10.9 ([#739](https://github.com/xerial/snappy-java/pull/739)). These methods now reject uncompressed lengths that are not a multiple of the element size with `SnappyIOException`.\n\n### Workarounds\nCheck that `Snappy.uncompressedLength(input)` is a multiple of the element size before calling these methods.\n",
        "markdown": "> ### Impact\n`Snappy.uncompressCharArray`, `uncompressShortArray`, `uncompressIntArray`, `uncompressLongArray`, `uncompressFloatArray` and `uncompressDoubleArray` sized the result array by dividing the declared uncompressed byte length by the element size, but native code wrote the full byte length. If the declared length is not a multiple of the element size, up to 7 bytes are written past the end of the Java array, corrupting the heap.\n\n### Patches\nFixed in 1.1.10.9 ([#739](https://github.com/xerial/snappy-java/pull/739)). These methods now reject uncompressed lengths that are not a multiple of the element size with `SnappyIOException`.\n\n### Workarounds\nCheck that `Snappy.uncompressedLength(input)` is a multiple of the element size before calling these methods.\n\n|                                                                                                                                 |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:maven/org.xerial.snappy/snappy-java@1.1.10.7  |\n|Affected range                                                                 <=1.1.10.8                                        |\n|Fixed version                                                                  1.1.10.9                                          |\n|[[CVSS Score 7.5] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H]]                                                    |\n"
       },
       "properties": {
        "affected_version": "<=1.1.10.8",
        "cvssV3": 7.5,
        "cvssV3_severity": "HIGH",
        "cvssV3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H",
        "fixed_version": "1.1.10.9",
        "purls": [
         "pkg:maven/org.xerial.snappy/snappy-java@1.1.10.7"
        ],
        "security-severity": "7.5",
        "tags": [
         "HIGH"
        ]
       }
